{
  "key": 2430,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000469_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "There are boulders blocking the way\n",
        "inside the cavern...\r",
        "I think a Pokémon’s hidden move will be\n",
        "able to smash those boulders, though."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000469_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Rt. 204\n",
        "Jubilife City"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000469_00002",
      "en_US": "Ravaged Path"
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_Arc2RuthReadings",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth: The readings go wild past\n",
        "that wall. Right where the rift is.\r",
        "I'll stay here and watch. Shout if\n",
        "anything... shouts back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_Arc2CyrusStayClose",
      "en_US": "Cyrus: Stay close to me."
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_Arc2GruntRightOnTime",
      "en_US": [
        "Eclipse Grunt: Right on time.\n",
        "Just like we were told."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_Arc2GruntWalkedOut",
      "en_US": [
        "Eclipse Grunt: So you're the one who\n",
        "walked out. Huh.\r",
        "Thought you'd be taller."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_Arc2GruntDoesntMatter",
      "en_US": [
        "Eclipse Grunt: Doesn't matter.\r",
        "This site's given us all it's\n",
        "going to."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_Arc2CyrusEllipsis",
      "en_US": "Cyrus: ..."
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_Arc2CyrusSeenMachine",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: I have seen a machine like\n",
        "this before."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_Arc2RuthHowDidTheyKnow",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth: How did they know we'd be\n",
        "here? Only the five of us knew."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_Arc2CyrusHowThatLooks",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: ...Yes.\n",
        "I know how that looks."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_Arc2LedgerCyrus",
      "en_US": "Cyrus"
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_Arc2LedgerGarius",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}"
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_Arc2LedgerRuth",
      "en_US": "Ruth"
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_Arc2LedgerBadLuck",
      "en_US": "Bad luck"
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_Arc2ReactCyrus",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth: Cyrus? They knew his face.\r",
        "...But he fought them beside you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_Arc2ReactGarius",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth: {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}? He'd sooner eat his\n",
        "badge than help a dark coat."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_Arc2ReactRuth",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth: Me?! I took apart the\n",
        "Professor's Pokétch! That's IT!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_Arc2ReactBadLuck",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth: Bad luck? Maybe they've been\n",
        "camped out here for weeks."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_Arc2RuthEyesOpen",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth: ...Let's just keep our eyes\n",
        "open. All of us."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_Arc2CyrusGoThrough",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: Ruth stays with the\n",
        "readings. We go through together."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_Arc2RuthWatch",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth: I'll stay here and watch.\n",
        "Shout if anything... shouts back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_Arc2Frame",
      "en_US": [
        "A cracked metal frame, scorched\n",
        "violet, is bolted to the wall.\r",
        "Empty restraints hang from it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_Arc2RuthReadingsDropped",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth: The readings just dropped to\n",
        "nothing! You did it!\r",
        "...Wait. What is THAT?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_Arc2RuthItsClear",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth: It's clear. The Professor's\n",
        "shard is violet. It pulses.\r",
        "Like it hurts. This one's just...\n",
        "warm."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_Arc2RuthOneNight",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth: Give me one night. And give me\n",
        "your Portal Reader. I have an idea."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_Arc2HandedReader",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} handed Ruth the\n",
        "Portal Reader."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_EchoHum",
      "en_US": [
        "The Resonator hums against the\n",
        "frame. The air goes cold."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_EchoCrate",
      "en_US": "A crate. Its lid is pried open."
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_EchoStrapped",
      "en_US": [
        "Something is dragged out of it\n",
        "and strapped into the frame."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_EchoHitmonlee",
      "en_US": [
        "A Hitmonlee. It kicks and kicks.\n",
        "The straps hold."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_EchoTear",
      "en_US": "The air beside it tears open."
    },
    {
      "id": "RavagedPath_Text_EchoFade",
      "en_US": [
        "The hum fades.\n",
        "The restraints hang empty again."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
